    "text": "<p><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>101</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />So, the number of terms<math><mo>=</mo></math>( <math><mn>101</mn></math> terms of the form <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math> ) + (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>101</mn></math> terms of the form <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>202</mn></math> terms</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</m